{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>בור</b> — the sense of <b>ויחפרהו</b> is to increase its depth, and the word <b>בשחת</b> [in the pit] is a low place, with the meter of אשר זורה ברחת [which scatters with a winnowing shovel], from the root רוח. And some say: like בשחתם נתפש [when they corrupted, they were caught]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:33.761356737Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}